.prune-nodes A P31 Q310890
# Cell lines. Each of these carries its own instances -- pruning one does not
# reach the others, since .prune-nodes does not descend the hierarchy.
.prune-nodes A P31 Q21014462
.prune-nodes A P31 Q27555384
.prune-nodes A P31 Q23058136
.prune-nodes A P31 Q107103143
.prune-nodes A P31 Q107102664
.prune-nodes A P31 Q27671617
.prune-nodes A P31 Q27554370
.prune-nodes A P31 Q27555319
# Clinical trials.
.prune-nodes A P31 Q30612

# --- Academic publishing ---------------------------------------------------
# One item per paper, with its authors, subjects and journal. Useful to a
# bibliometrician, dead weight to everyone else.
.prune-nodes A P31 Q13442814
.prune-nodes A P31 Q13433827
.prune-nodes A P31 Q6451276
.prune-nodes A P31 Q23927052
.prune-nodes A P31 Q1143604
.prune-facts A P1433 B
.prune-facts A P921 B

# --- The Wikimedia project's own pages -------------------------------------
# Categories, templates, modules, list and disambiguation pages. These are not
