# --- One item per number, per day, per hour --------------------------------
# Wikidata holds an item for every integer with a property worth naming, and
# for every calendar day of every year. They answer no question that is not
# arithmetic.
.prune-nodes A P31 Q47150325
.prune-nodes A P31 Q49008
.prune-nodes A P31 Q28920044
.prune-nodes A P31 Q50707
.prune-nodes A P31 Q467511
